OL,3,GNEWSAMurder scene after mum was beaten
OL,4,Ato death by son was like 'horror film'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe murder scene after a mum was
OL,7,Fbludgeoned to death by her son was like
OL,8,Fsomething out of a "horror film", a
OL,9,Fpolice officer has said.
OL,11,FAngela Shellis, 45, was found in the
OL,12,FCoed y Morfa nature reserve in
OL,13,FPrestatyn, Flintshire, on 25 October
OL,14,F2025.
OL,16,FShe had been beaten to death by her son
OL,17,FTristan Roberts, 18, who hated women
OL,18,Fand was obsessed with violence and
OL,19,Fserial killers.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
